function recursive_reverse over T takes list of T xs returns list of T is
    if length of xs is 0
        return empty list of T
    end if
    constant rest is empty list of T
    repeat with x in xs
        append x to rest
    end repeat
    remove item 1 from rest
    constant tail is the result of recursive_reverse rest
    append item 1 of xs to tail
    return tail
end function

constant nums is the result of recursive_reverse list of 1, 2, 3, 4
say nums
constant words is the result of recursive_reverse list of "a", "b"
say words
